父莊交遊、向孝武推薦幼朏；固定WYG宋085原253至269行明王景文琅邪臨沂、名與明帝諱同、少與謝莊齊名，與現宋孝武王彧謝莊一雙同人。正文王景文不靜改彧，非魏王凌掾同名王彧。","human_reviewed":false,"reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"external_reference_readings":[{"id":"r-song085-wangjingwen","title":"宋書卷85 WYG","revision_id":"e80c057667e3c8684f11d5088251e10244d5a264","url":"https://github.com/kanripo/KR2a0016/blob/e80c057667e3c8684f11d5088251e10244d5a264/KR2a0016_085.txt","raw_path":"source-evidence/liang015-xiefei-reading/external/song085-kanripo-fixed.txt","metadata_path":"source-evidence/liang015-xiefei-reading/external/song085-kanripo-metadata.json","raw_sha256":"ec55e60f6fd810955ca124d6369929c7e49f2092b64977ab85d082e03e9abeea","raw_start":5832,"raw_end":6231,"quote":"王景文琅邪臨沂人也名與明帝諱同祖穆臨海太守¶\n伯父智少簡貴有髙名髙祖甚重之常云見王智使人¶\n思仲祖與劉穆之謀討劉毅而智在焉它日穆之白髙¶\n祖曰伐國重事也公云何乃使王智知髙祖笑曰此人¶\n髙簡豈聞此輩論議其見知如此爲太尉咨議叅軍從¶\n征長安留爲桂陽公義真安西將軍司馬天水太守還¶\n<pb:KR2a0016_WYG_085-15a>¶\n爲宋國五兵尚書晉陵太守加秩中二千石封建陵縣¶\n五等子追贈太常父僧朗亦以謹實見知元嘉中爲侍¶\n中勤於朝直未甞違惰太祖嘉之以爲湘州刺史世祖¶\n大明末爲尚書左僕射太宗初以后父爲特進左光祿¶\n大夫又進開府儀同三司固讓乃加侍中特進尋薨追¶\n贈開府諡曰元公景文出繼智幼爲從叔球所知美風¶\n姿好言理少與陳郡謝莊齊名太祖甚相欽重故爲太¶\n宗娶景文妹而以景文名與太宗同髙祖第五女新安¶\n<pb:KR2a0016_WYG_085-15b>¶\n公主先適太原王景深離絶當以適景文固辭以疾故¶\n","text_layer":"received_chapter","read_scope":"僅王景文獨立傳起首原253至269行（含頁標），核名與明帝諱同及謝莊交遊；並非全卷校讀。","image_verified":false,"human_reviewed":false}]},{"id":"d-qi032-ruantao-wangyu","person_id":"1tc_q18_x7v","surfaces":["王彧"],"scope":"cross_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-nanqishu-032-ruantao","c-nanshi-024-wang-family"],"status":"contextual_provisional","confidence_level":"high","identification_basis":{"kind":"source_context","target_mention_ids":["c-nanqishu-032-ruantao:line094:m0014","c-nanshi-024-wang-family:line047:m0168"]},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanqishu","book_id":"b-nanqishu-032","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-032-ruantao","source_id":"s-nanqishu-032-ruantao","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-032-ruantao:line094","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/nanqishu/032-ruantao.json"},{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-024","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-024-wang-family","source_id":"s-nanshi-024-wang-family","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-024-wang-family:line047","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/nanshi/024.json"}],"rationale":"兩書同記宋孝武所選四侍中王彧與謝莊一雙、阮韜與何偃一雙。宋書王景文名與明帝諱同，明帝諱彧，故此王彧屬王景文身份；不與帝彧合人。","references":[{"title":"《宋書》卷85正文","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%AE%8B%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B785&oldid=2069101","source_revision":2069101,"quote":"王景文，琅邪臨沂人也。名與明帝諱同。","source_position":{"first_line":72,"last_line":72},"wikitext_sha256":"69128313de5d9e3a6bec92be7457d6749458b0c862ee563e22cd8e4dcb0392ea","image_verified":false},{"title":"《宋書》卷8正文","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2309997","source_revision":2309997,"quote":"太宗明皇帝諱彧","source_position":{"first_line":2,"last_line":2},"wikitext_sha256":"a4a72e52fc502f1fc8c275a54343ca8c594e57286f51496a6f18eb44425e8a05","image_verified":false}],"human_reviewed":false,"model":null},{"id":"d-nanqi043-xieyue-wangyu","person_id":"1tc_q18_x7v","surfaces":["王彧"],"scope":"cross_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-nanqishu-043-xieyue","c-nanshi-024-wang-family"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanqishu","book_id":"b-nanqishu-043","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-043-xieyue","source_id":"s-nanqishu043-ws2400356","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-043-xieyue:p002","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/nanqishu/043-xieyue.json"},{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-024","source_id":"s-nanshi-024-wang-family","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-024-wang-family","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-024-wang-family:line047","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/nanshi/024.json"}],"rationale":"七歲𤅢獲王彧向宋孝武薦見；既錄南024宋孝武選侍中時王彧與謝莊一雙，正是同一帝朝與父莊交遊的王彧，非魏王凌掾同名王彧。","human_reviewed":false,"reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-liangshu-015-xiefei","work_id":"w-liangshu","book_id":"b-liangshu-015","source_id":"s-liangshu015-ws1506954","source_ref":"corpus/liangshu/015-xiefei.json"},{"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-032-ruantao","work_id":"w-nanqishu","book_id":"b-nanqishu-032","source_id":"s-nanqishu-032-